    "detailed_description": "Overview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDescend into the depths of the unknown with &quot;Underwater,&quot; a VR survival horror game that plunges you into the heart of terror. Set in a collapsing marine biology research station deep within the Mariana Trench, you'll find yourself hunted by an unknown entity as you struggle to survive. As chaos ensues within the confines of the research facility, you must navigate treacherous waters, scavenge for resources, and unravel the mysteries lurking in the shadows. Will you uncover the truth behind the station's downfall and find a means of escape, or will you become another victim of the abyss?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmersive VR experience: Dive into a fully realized virtual world where every shadow hides a potential threat.<br />\r\nSurvival horror gameplay: Use stealth, wit, and resourcefulness to outsmart your pursuer and survive the nightmarish depths.<br />\r\nAtmospheric setting: Explore the eerie corridors of the research station, rendered with stunning detail and atmospheric effects.<br />\r\nStrategic hiding and item collection: Utilize the environment to your advantage, collecting essential items while evading detection.<br />\r\nRich lore and terror: Piece together the chilling narrative through scattered documents and recordings, uncovering the dark secrets hidden beneath the waves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the ultimate test of survival, where every moment could be your last in the unforgiving depths of the ocean.",
    "about_the_game": "Overview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDescend into the depths of the unknown with &quot;Underwater,&quot; a VR survival horror game that plunges you into the heart of terror. Set in a collapsing marine biology research station deep within the Mariana Trench, you'll find yourself hunted by an unknown entity as you struggle to survive. As chaos ensues within the confines of the research facility, you must navigate treacherous waters, scavenge for resources, and unravel the mysteries lurking in the shadows. Will you uncover the truth behind the station's downfall and find a means of escape, or will you become another victim of the abyss?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nImmersive VR experience: Dive into a fully realized virtual world where every shadow hides a potential threat.<br />\r\nSurvival horror gameplay: Use stealth, wit, and resourcefulness to outsmart your pursuer and survive the nightmarish depths.<br />\r\nAtmospheric setting: Explore the eerie corridors of the research station, rendered with stunning detail and atmospheric effects.<br />\r\nStrategic hiding and item collection: Utilize the environment to your advantage, collecting essential items while evading detection.<br />\r\nRich lore and terror: Piece together the chilling narrative through scattered documents and recordings, uncovering the dark secrets hidden beneath the waves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the ultimate test of survival, where every moment could be your last in the unforgiving depths of the ocean.",
